WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.190
If you take injectable GLP-1 medications or other weight loss drugs such as phentermine,

2
00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:05.760
.

3
00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:08.880
there's an important step to be aware of before your procedure.

4
00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:14.840
These medications slow digestion, which can affect how your stomach empties and

5
00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:15.600
may interfere with

6
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.790
your prep. For that reason, your care team may ask you to hold your GLP-1 before

7
00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:22.240
your colonoscopy.

8
00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:26.480
Typically, you will need to hold your dose for one week, but if you are not

9
00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:26.800
sure,

10
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:30.760
please call your doctor's office to confirm exactly when to take your last dose

11
00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:30.960
.

12
00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:36.000
Do not stop or adjust any medication without speaking with them first.

13
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.720
We just want to make sure everything goes smoothly on procedure day.
